## Interface: 16001
## Title: ZoneRecipeWaypoints
## Notes: On entering a zone, sets TomTom waypoints for the trainers and vendors there that teach or sell recipes your professions are missing. Hides seasonal recipes. Uses the RecipeRadar database.
## Dependencies: RecipeRadar
## OptionalDeps: TomTom
## SavedVariables: ZoneRecipeWaypointsDB
